      "created_at": "2012-05-14T20:40:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone, I’ve just experienced the great fun that is Sentinels of the Multiverse last night for the first time.  I loved it so much I went on Kickstarter and pledged for the game and all the expansion packs!</p>\n<p>I’m sorry if this has come up already in discussion, but I did a search and couldn’t find it, but one of the problems we came across last night was interaction between Legacy’s Galvanize and Fanatic’s Embolden.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Normally Fanatic deals 2 damage to whoever she emboldens, but if Legacy were to galvanize, does that mean she does 3 damage to the hero she is helping instead?</span></p>\n<p>When we did it last night, we thought it didn’t make very much thematic sense, so we had embolden still do 2 damage, but we are curious what the official rule was.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
